The SLC621 is a device with wattage (W) and kilowatt hours (kWh) measurement functions. It allows you to control On/Off status and to check real-time energy usage via mobile App.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0
- Measure the instantaneous and accumulative energy usage of the connected devices
- Schedule the device to automatically power electronics on and off
- 16A Dry contact output
- Lightweight and easy to install
- Extend the range and strengthen ZigBee network communication
